  {
    "id": "poetry-02",
    "slug": "poem-02",
    "historical_number": "2",
    "text": "Being present\nA hard construct, filters include most activities besides being still.\nStill is the nature of nature\nKale is creeping out of my skin force fed myself pounds of the green\nstuff\nEnjoy the present moment it is a gift clouds of doubt and fear isolate\nyour bright sun with fog",
