  {
    "id": "poetry-03",
    "slug": "poem-03",
    "historical_number": "3",
    "text": "Grammar a rudimentary formula punctuated by a battalion of\nstructure created by the patriarchy to continue to frame the\nhierarchical structure of the hoops I'm reminded by the media\neveryday to jump though.",
