  {
    "id": "poetry-06",
    "slug": "poem-06",
    "historical_number": "6",
    "text": "I am filled with light. Praise to the universe. Bring me to my\nhome, fill my pockets enough to pay for it and my dreams of\nmaking films. Continue to give me strength in darkness that it\nwill all pour to light for me. Love and light and the best are\ninvited to enter me. Swell my heart.",
    "text_sha256": "8729804a28fe4623dfb0b090715c90fd2f540c795891b42d68960d1cc54820b1",
    "author": "Chloe Starr",
