    "id": "poetry-23",
    "slug": "poem-23",
    "historical_number": "22",
    "text": "Oh m triple G. I hate how fucking small this town is. I hope I have\nhid myself well enough with all this red lips and sunglasses. I’m so\ntired of running into people that know me but I don’t can to see it is\nlike it is all planned for Heightened Dramatic Irony.",
