    "id": "poetry-33",
    "slug": "poem-33",
    "historical_number": "32",
    "text": "i open the love spell bottle\nthe perfume is so enticing\ni am in love with its intoxication\ni shouldn’t but i do drop it on my eyelids\nchaos without intention\nmy headache is gone\na heartache awaits\ncurses for getting this high on magic\ni can feel it working already\nmy heart is beating faster\nand the scent will not leave my nose\naction rising.",
